- **tagline:** `An open-source multi-AI team for brainstorming, design, coding, testing and cloud deploys — ship fast at budget price and never lose control.`

I dropped the long `● SYSTEM STATUS…` prefix from the tagline to keep it short (that status still lives in `guide/introduction.md`). Actions and feature cards are unchanged.

